MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- lib/firebase-services.ts: subscribeToPresence() listens to /presence RTDB path
- app/page.tsx:
  - subscribe to RTDB presence map (instant onDisconnect events)
  - filteredApplications useMemo now overrides isOnline from RTDB presence
  - periodic 30s tick forces re-evaluation even without Firestore updates
  - fallback: lastActiveAt 30s window for legacy/non-RTDB visitors

Data flow:
  Visitor opens swiftmove → RTDB presence/docId = {online:true}
  Visitor closes browser → onDisconnect fires → presence/docId = {online:false}
  Dashboard RTDB listener fires → filteredApplications useMemo recomputes → UI shows ⚪
